the Saveable is a contract.
this allows Saved.
this allows Booming.

the OnlySaved is a contract.
this allows Saved.

the Game is an actor.
this can Inner.
this's Inner does...
    that is Saveable.
    if input exists?
        this is Saved!
    or?
        this is Booming!

this can Outer.
this's Outer does...
    that is OnlySaved.
    do this's Inner...
        when that is Saved?
            this is Saved!

the App is a script.
do Game's Outer.
